OVERVIEW: Register and manage the apps (bundle IDs) attesting under this
organization.

USAGE: grantiva console apps <subcommand>

OPTIONS:
  --version               Show the version.
  -h, --help              Show help information.

SUBCOMMANDS:
  list                    List registered apps, primary first.
  get                     Show one app by bundle ID or UUID.
  register                Register an app so devices running it can attest.
  update                  Rename an app or change its description and toggles.
  delete                  Delete an app and everything attached to it.
  activate                Allow attestations from this app.
  deactivate              Stop accepting attestations from this app. The
                          primary app cannot be deactivated.
  set-primary             Make this app the primary app. It must be active.

  See 'grantiva help console apps <subcommand>' for detailed help.
